<title>POLAND: BPR NET RISES TO 2.19 MLN IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>BPR NET RISES TO 2.19 MLN IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  2.19 vs   -1.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.74 vs   -0.65</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  6.77 vs    5.41</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	14.36 vs   12.90</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 22.21 vs   13.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   38.37 vs   24.45</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 68.74 vs   53.45</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     147.30 vs  114.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
